      "blurb": "Small opportunistic primate pest, native to Tuchanka",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Pyjaks are small primates native to Tuchanka, where they survived the nuclear exchanges that scarred the planet by being numerous, fast, and just edible enough that varren kept their own population in check rather than eliminating pyjaks entirely. They are considered pests on most vessels foolish enough to allow one aboard, and are technically illegal to import to several systems due to their status as an invasive species on at least six garden worlds.</p><p><strong>Scavenger's Instinct:</strong> +2 circ. bonus to Stealth checks when adjacent to difficult terrain or a large object.</p>",
